# The Graph — Subgraph Studio API key.
#
# Used by the pull pipeline (gateway queries) and by the hosted Subgraph MCP at
# subgraphs.mcp.thegraph.com/sse. Without it a pull cannot re-run; the committed runs and their transcripts
# re-score fine without it, because scoring touches no network at all.
#
# Get one at https://thegraph.com/studio → your subgraph → API keys. Copy this file to .env and fill it in.
# Never commit the filled copy, and never write the key into bench/** — a transcript is published evidence.
GRAPH_API_KEY=
